      47.85,
      464.65,
      539.85,
      487.72
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 20(4)(b) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Bandula Gunawardana,Minister Higher Education, Technology and Innovation, do by this Order -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      60.45,
      500.65,
      539.95,
      583.72
    ],
    "text": "(a) on being satisfied that the administration of the affairs of the Gampaha Wickrmarachchi Ayurveda Institute havebeen seriously dislocated and that the authorities of the said institute have failed to restore normal conditions,appoint Senior Professor Janitha Abeywickrama Liyanage to be the Competent Authority with effect from December13, 2019 for the purpose of exercising, peforming and discharging in lieu of the Director of the GampahaWickramarachchi Ayurveda Institute, any power, duty or function respectively which has been conferred or imposedon, or assigned to the said Director under the said Act, or under any Order, Ordinance, Statute, By-Law, Regulationor Rule made thereunder ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      59.85,
      596.65,
      539.85,
      619.72
    ],
    "text": "(b) rescind the Order made under Section 20(4)(b) and published in the Government Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 2148/34 of November 7, 2019.",
